TI  - Landscape genomics and selection signatures of local adaptation of Eritrean indigenous cattle along environmental gradients
T2  - TROPICAL ANIMAL HEALTH AND PRODUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Adaptive
KW  - Geographical barriers
KW  - Isolation by distance
KW  - Single-nucleotide polymorphisms
